		{
			title: "学习冶炼金属 (Learning to Smelt)"
			icon: "minecraft:furnace"
			x: 7.5d
			y: -14.0d
			subtitle: "在没有熔炉的情况下熔炼一些石头，然后提交"
			description: [
				"快围过来，我亲爱的学生们，我要分享一个有用的法术。"
				""
				"&b熔炼&r咒语是仅有的几种熔炼方式之一，因为&c熔炉被禁止了&r，不够巫师范儿。"
				""
				"它会弹出方块位置向量或掉落物品实体，然后&6将其熔炼&r，每熔炼一个物品消耗四分之三紫水晶粉尘。下面的例子使用的是掉落物品。"
				""
				"{image:ftbai:textures/quests/hex/smelt_entity.png width:320 height:50 align:1}"
				""
				"按照从右到左的顺序排列："
				""
				"[\"\",\"1. \",{\"text\":\"[ 心智倒影 ]\",\"color\":\"yellow\",\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"run_command\",\"value\":\"/open-book hexcasting:thehexbook hexcasting:patterns/basics 1\"},\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_text\",\"contents\":[\"在书中显示给我看\"]}},\" 会推动你\"]"
				""
				"[\"\", \"2. \", {\"text\":\"[ 指南针的净化 ] \",\"color\":\"yellow\",\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"run_command\",\"value\":\"/open-book hexcasting:thehexbook hexcasting:patterns/basics 2\"},\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_text\",\"contents\":[\"在书中显示\"]}},\"弹出物品并推入你的坐标向量\"]"
				""
				"[\"\",\"3. \",{\"text\":\"[ 心智倒影 ]\",\"color\":\"yellow\",\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"run_command\",\"value\":\"/open-book hexcasting:thehexbook hexcasting:patterns/basics 1\"},\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_text\",\"contents\":[\"在书中显示给我看\"]}},\" 再次推动你\"]"
				""
				"[\"\", \"4. \", {\"text\":\"[ Alidade's Purification ]\",\"color\":\"yellow\",\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"run_command\",\"value\":\"/open-book hexcasting:thehexbook hexcasting:patterns/basics 3\"},\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_text\",\"contents\":[\"在书中显示\"]}},\" 弹出物品并向你面朝的方向推送一个向量\"]"
				""
				"[\"\", \"5. \", {\"text\":\"[ 侦察兵的蒸馏 ]\",\"color\":\"yellow\",\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"run_command\",\"value\":\"/open-book hexcasting:thehexbook hexcasting:patterns/basics 10\"},\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_text\",\"contents\":[\"在书中显示\"]}},\" 弹出两个向量，并推入正在注视的实体。仅在注视实体时编写此指令（使用 F3+B 查看实体的边界框）。\"]"
				""
				"弹出物品掉落实体并将其熔炼，结束Hex。\"]"
			]
